ies in the world as his constituents. And he's not afraid to tell it how it is. Anyways, this guy's going to be a camera. I don't know if he's going to be Senator or Governor, or hate him to see him being on the ticket someday. Anyways, he's a cumber. Get to know Roe. Get to know Roe.",
